[{"page": 1, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q7-1", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "T7. Nitrogen Fixation", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 150.9783477783203, 225.4873809814453, 172.68597412109375]}, {"text": "7%", "bbox": [290.6499938964844, 193.6215057373047, 304.6280822753906, 207.18873596191406]}, {"text": "7.1", "bbox": [172.68299865722656, 209.5625, 186.7479705810547, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "7.2", "bbox": [204.3090057373047, 209.5625, 218.37399291992188, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "7.3", "bbox": [235.93499755859375, 209.5625, 249.99998474121094, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "7.4", "bbox": [267.5610046386719, 209.5625, 281.6259765625, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "7.5", "bbox": [299.18701171875, 209.5625, 313.2519836425781, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "7.6", "bbox": [330.81298828125, 209.5625, 344.8779602050781, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "7.7", "bbox": [362.4389953613281, 209.5625, 376.50396728515625, 223.12973022460938]}, {"text": "∑", "bbox": [403.7760009765625, 194.6659698486328, 412.8818054199219, 229.256103515625]}, {"text": "3", "bbox": [176.86700439453125, 225.50250244140625, 182.5634002685547, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "8", "bbox": [208.4929962158203, 225.50250244140625, 214.18939208984375, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "15", "bbox": [237.27099609375, 225.50250244140625, 248.66600036621094, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "3", "bbox": [271.7449951171875, 225.50250244140625, 277.4413757324219, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "6", "bbox": [303.3710021972656, 225.50250244140625, 309.0673828125, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "6", "bbox": [334.99700927734375, 225.50250244140625, 340.6933898925781, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "13", "bbox": [363.7749938964844, 225.50250244140625, 375.16998291015625, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "54", "bbox": [402.6319885253906, 225.50250244140625, 414.0269775390625, 239.06973266601562]}, {"text": "The Haber–Bosch process is the principal industrial method for ammonia production. A simplified dia-", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 259.33349609375, 538.5518798828125, 272.9007263183594]}, {"text": "gram of an ammonia synthesis plant is shown below.", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 271.28851318359375, 304.493408203125, 284.8557434082031]}, {"text": "Fig. 1. M1 - Mixture 1, M2 - Mixture 2, Z −CO2 scrubber, CLR - cooler", "bbox": [136.58099365234375, 491.969970703125, 458.6917419433594, 526.5601196289062]}, {"text": "In the following calculations, assume that all reactions in Fig. 1, except NH3 formation, are quantitative.", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 526.8085327148438, 538.575439453125, 542.86669921875]}, {"text": "7.1", "bbox": [78.60797119140625, 549.7205200195312, 92.8423080444336, 563.2877197265625]}, {"text": "Tick the gases contained in M1 and M2; and tick the correct relationship be-", "bbox": [114.69251251220703, 549.7205200195312, 480.58184814453125, 563.2877197265625]}, {"text": "tween 𝑥and 𝑦.", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 546.7599487304688, 182.2466278076172, 581.35009765625]}, {"text": "3.0 pt", "bbox": [495.4499816894531, 549.6444702148438, 521.8193969726562, 563.211669921875]}, {"text": "An ammonia production complex with a capacity of 660, 000 tons per year was commissioned at the", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 575.8809814453125, 538.575439453125, 610.4711303710938]}, {"text": "Navoiazot plant in Uzbekistan, which operates with a 97.0% of overall yield.", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 587.8359985351562, 401.7815246582031, 622.4261474609375]}, {"text": "7.2", "bbox": [78.60798645019531, 625.716552734375, 92.84232330322266, 639.2837524414062]}, {"text": "Calculate the mass of CH4 (tons) required annually to produce 660, 000 tons of", "bbox": [114.6925277709961, 610.8009643554688, 480.5768127441406, 645.39111328125]}, {"text": "ammonia, if the Navoiazot operates according to the Fig. 1.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 637.6715087890625, 390.5526428222656, 651.2387084960938]}, {"text": "8.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 625.6405029296875, 521.8194580078125, 639.2077026367188]}]}, {"page": 2, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q7-2", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "Consider a model of a real reaction system, which includes recirculation of reagents. An open system", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 155.21949768066406, 538.5646362304688, 168.78672790527344]}, {"text": "operates in a cyclic mode. Each cycle consists of four steps:", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 167.17449951171875, 332.52813720703125, 180.74172973632812]}, {"text": "1. A stoichiometric N2 : H2 = 1 : 3 mixture with a total amount of n0 mol is fed into the reactor after", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 185.1074981689453, 538.5800170898438, 201.1657257080078]}, {"text": "each cycle.", "bbox": [81.60000610351562, 197.0625, 131.83209228515625, 210.62973022460938]}, {"text": "2. The reaction proceeds with a constant yield of 𝜂= 0.150.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 200.07997131347656, 342.89794921875, 234.67010498046875]}, {"text": "3. Ammonia is separated by liquification.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 232.92849731445312, 260.1802978515625, 246.4957275390625]}, {"text": "4. Unreacted gases are returned into the reactor.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 250.86050415039062, 299.5723876953125, 264.427734375]}, {"text": "The cycle is repeated until the required overall yield is reached.", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 268.79351806640625, 350.3114318847656, 282.3607482910156]}, {"text": "Fig. 2. M2. – Mixture 2, CLR - cooler.", "bbox": [212.4250030517578, 388.635498046875, 382.8464660644531, 402.2027282714844]}, {"text": "7.3", "bbox": [78.60797119140625, 411.8475036621094, 92.8423080444336, 425.41473388671875]}, {"text": "a) Calculate the amount of nitrogen, present in the system after the 58th cycle", "bbox": [114.69097137451172, 411.8475036621094, 480.5833740234375, 425.41473388671875]}, {"text": "(before the addition of 59th portion of mixture), if 𝑛0 = 4 mol. Provide 4 decimal", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 408.886962890625, 480.5764465332031, 445.0655517578125]}, {"text": "places. Hint: a formula for the sum of the terms of a geometric progression is", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 435.7574768066406, 480.57940673828125, 449.32470703125]}, {"text": "needed.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 447.7134704589844, 149.45909118652344, 461.28070068359375]}, {"text": "b) Calculate the number of cycles needed to increase the overall yield from", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 459.66845703125, 480.5923156738281, 473.2357177734375]}, {"text": "15.0% to 97.0%.", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 471.62347412109375, 188.2455291748047, 485.1907043457031]}, {"text": "15.0 pt", "bbox": [495.1519775390625, 411.771484375, 526.921142578125, 425.3387145996094]}, {"text": "An aqueous solution of 3 is being used to remove CO2 from the mixture.", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 499.0625, 395.6616516113281, 515.1207275390625]}, {"text": "7.4", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 579.9744873046875, 92.84233856201172, 593.5416870117188]}, {"text": "Write the equation for this reaction.", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 579.9744873046875, 283.9048156738281, 593.5416870117188]}, {"text": "3.0 pt", "bbox": [495.4499816894531, 579.8994750976562, 521.8193969726562, 593.4666748046875]}, {"text": "Complex 5 is obtained through the fixation of the molecular nitrogen according to the scheme below.", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 610.6575317382812, 530.1485595703125, 624.2247314453125]}]}, {"page": 3, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q7-3", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "7.5", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 166.2294921875, 92.84233856201172, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "Draw the structure of 5 using simplified scheme for the ligand. Note that 1.00", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 166.2294921875, 480.5732727050781, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "g of 4 will react stoichiometrically with 94.97 cm3 of N2 at 273.15 K and 1.0 bar.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 177.10350036621094, 480.5804443359375, 197.146728515625]}, {"text": "6.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 166.15451049804688, 521.8194580078125, 179.72174072265625]}, {"text": "The effect of different reductants and additives on the yield of NH3 was examined. The different Red", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 210.87750244140625, 538.5685424804688, 226.93572998046875]}, {"text": "and Ad combinations, their respective E° and 𝑝𝐾𝑎, together with the resulting NH3 yield are presented", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 207.91697692871094, 538.5845336914062, 244.09556579589844]}, {"text": "below.", "bbox": [56.692962646484375, 234.78750610351562, 87.24891662597656, 248.354736328125]}]}, {"page": 4, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Theory", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 105.85767364501953, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q7-4", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "7.6", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 166.2294921875, 92.84233856201172, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "Rank the following Red/Ad combinations A-D by the decrease in ammonia", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 166.2294921875, 480.5736389160156, 179.79672241210938]}, {"text": "yield.", "bbox": [114.69099426269531, 178.18450927734375, 139.32916259765625, 191.75173950195312]}, {"text": "6.0 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 166.15451049804688, 521.8194580078125, 179.72174072265625]}, {"text": "Nitrogen fixation can also be achieved via binary nitrides (compounds containing N3−). Such nitrides 7,", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 426.9482116699219, 538.5826416015625, 458.0795593261719]}, {"text": "8, 9 were obtained from pure elements. When they are heated together with SiO2, red crystals of a stable", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 455.24847412109375, 538.57763671875, 471.01483154296875]}, {"text": "compound 10 are formed as the single product. The minimal possible formula, describing the structure", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 467.2034606933594, 538.5596923828125, 480.77069091796875]}, {"text": "of compound 10 is Q𝛼R𝛽S2T[Si12N24]. In addition:", "bbox": [56.693031311035156, 464.242919921875, 291.1836853027344, 500.4215087890625]}, {"text": "1. Mass fractions of nitrogen are 𝑤(N)7 =9.16%, 𝑤(N)8 =18.90%, 𝑤(N)9 =39.94%", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 482.17596435546875, 442.0718688964844, 519.2650756835938]}, {"text": "2. Q and R are metal cations in their highest oxidation state.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 515.0244750976562, 350.72808837890625, 528.5916748046875]}, {"text": "3. S is a monoatomic anion.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 532.9574584960938, 198.94546508789062, 546.524658203125]}, {"text": "4. T is an anion with tetrahedral configuration.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 550.8894653320312, 287.01788330078125, 564.4566650390625]}, {"text": "5. For the quantitative formation of 10, the mass ratio 7 : 8 : 9 : SiO2 = 5.09 : 2.96 : 3.27 : 1.00.", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 568.822509765625, 507.1567077636719, 584.8807373046875]}, {"text": "7.7", "bbox": [78.6080322265625, 591.7875366210938, 92.84236907958984, 605.354736328125]}, {"text": "Identify the empirical formulae of 7 – 10. Specify the composition of anions S", "bbox": [114.69257354736328, 591.7874755859375, 480.584228515625, 605.354736328125]}, {"text": "and T.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 606.0344848632812, 143.59664916992188, 619.6016845703125]}, {"text": "13.0 pt", "bbox": [495.15203857421875, 591.7124633789062, 526.9212036132812, 605.2796630859375]}]}]